<title>SPAIN: Spain's Cortefiel first-half profit 958 mln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Cortefiel first-half profit 958 mln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Cortefiel Group registered net profit of 958 million pesetas in its first half, which ended on August 31, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>This represented a rise of 7 percent on the same period last year.</p>
<p>The gross operating result was 2.740 billion, up 19 percent on the previous year. Sales grew 13 percent to 26.497 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167 ($ = 127.3 Spanish Pesetas)</p>
</text>
